stmt←prepareQuery(_con sql);st;result
⍝ Prepare a SQL statement with parameters
⍝ _con: connection pointer
⍝ sql: SQL query string (use $1, $2, etc. or ?name for parameters)
⍝ Returns: prepared statement pointer or 0 on error

:If _con=0
    ⎕←'Connection is closed!'
    stmt←0 ⋄ →0
:EndIf

(st stmt)←api.duckdb_prepare _con sql 6

:if st
  stmt←0
:endif


⍝ KSL 1.0.1
